          "feedUrl": "https://feeds.acast.com/public/shows/67e43ea31d0429552eaf0374",
          "description": "No Book Story Time brings classic stories to life through fun, musical storytelling for children under 7. Each episode features a warm narrator, lively character voices, and catchy original songs that keep young listeners engaged. From Little Red Riding Hood to Cinderella, these timeless tales are retold with humor, heart, and gentle lessons about kindness, courage, gratitude, and making good choices. A perfect screen-free option for car rides, playtime, family listening, and busy days, No Book Story Time offers joyful, imaginative storytime for kids and parents alike. Hosted on Acast. See acast.com/privacy for more information.",
